{"2616740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Handsome and Brave", "steam_appid": 2616740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.poster.avif?t=1770824893\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.webm?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.mp4?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handsome and Brave is a story about a <strong>World</strong> in turmoil and a <strong>Knight</strong> that can't save it. But he's not alone, he has you. As a <strong>Player</strong> you can pickup, move, and most importantly throw the <strong><i>rag-doll</i></strong> <strong>Knight</strong>. Together you'll embark on an epic adventure to vanquish the evil <strong>Wizard</strong> and restore <strong>Law</strong> to the <strong>World</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solving Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Knight's</strong> uniquely resistant body and can-do attitude make him the perfect tool for any occasion. Some of his uses are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening Locks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baking Bread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turning Cranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switching Switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquishing villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producing lasting pieces of art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to utilize his <strong><i>rag-doll</i></strong> body to explore this beautiful broken <strong>World</strong> at your own pace and solve the clever puzzles left by the dastardly people that broke it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Helping People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.poster.avif?t=1770824893\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.webm?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.mp4?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you'll meet an ambitious Director, distraught Villagers, and misguided gods. All of them have a story to tell and problems to fix.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save the World you'll have to travel from the highest peaks to the depths of the Underworld. There is no shortage of dangers to face and old secrets to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.poster.avif?t=1770824893\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.webm?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/7b79f1a4be056e526a90d06482da0031.mp4?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handsome and Brave is a story about a <strong>World</strong> in turmoil and a <strong>Knight</strong> that can't save it. But he's not alone, he has you. As a <strong>Player</strong> you can pickup, move, and most importantly throw the <strong><i>rag-doll</i></strong> <strong>Knight</strong>. Together you'll embark on an epic adventure to vanquish the evil <strong>Wizard</strong> and restore <strong>Law</strong> to the <strong>World</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solving Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Knight's</strong> uniquely resistant body and can-do attitude make him the perfect tool for any occasion. Some of his uses are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening Locks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baking Bread</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turning Cranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switching Switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming Produce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquishing villains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producing lasting pieces of art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to utilize his <strong><i>rag-doll</i></strong> body to explore this beautiful broken <strong>World</strong> at your own pace and solve the clever puzzles left by the dastardly people that broke it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Helping People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.poster.avif?t=1770824893\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.webm?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/extras/f20a95fad03d665f6549c2a4772357d1.mp4?t=1770824893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you'll meet an ambitious Director, distraught Villagers, and misguided gods. All of them have a story to tell and problems to fix.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save the World you'll have to travel from the highest peaks to the depths of the Underworld. There is no shortage of dangers to face and old secrets to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "Use the Knight's indestructible ragdoll body to embark on an epic adventure to solve puzzles, fix problems, and save the Kingdom", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/header.jpg?t=1770824893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/4c6d1c5b6ead85014cb28c2d9206e77506125803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770824893", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616740/4c6d1c5b6ead85014cb28c2d9206e77506125803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770824893", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8.1, 10 x86/x64, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E4500 (2 * 2200) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9600 GT (512 MB) / Intel HD Graphics 2500<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB availab